					<description>A poor traveler named &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Vector&lt;/color&gt; is approaching looking for help. &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Vector&lt;/color&gt; is begging for x30 silver. &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Vector&lt;/color&gt; wants the silver to pay off a debt to a gang of pirates who are hunting him.

You can give items to &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Vector&lt;/color&gt; by selecting a colonist and right-clicking on him.

&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Vector&lt;/color&gt; will move on after &lt;color=#87F6F6FF&gt;1 day&lt;/color&gt;.

